# MeiliSearch Configuration
MEILI_MASTER_KEY=your_secure_master_key_here
MEILISEARCH_KEY=your_secure_master_key_here

# IMPORTANT: Both MEILI_MASTER_KEY and MEILISEARCH_KEY must have the SAME value!
# MEILI_MASTER_KEY is used by MeiliSearch server
# MEILISEARCH_KEY is used by data-loader and Rails app to authenticate
# If they don't match, you'll get "invalid_api_key" 403 authentication errors

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. Replace BOTH placeholder values with the SAME secure key
# 3. Make sure .env is in your .gitignore file
# 4. For development, you can use any secure string as the master key
# 5. Example: Both keys set to "development_master_key_12345"
